  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Healthy &amp; Prosperous Pacific Ocean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity will continue work to address the multifaceted threats facing the region through robust ocean governance and &apos;blue economy&apos; initiatives, all informed by traditional knowledge and high-quality science. It will invest in the work of the Pacific Community Centre for Ocean Science, support additional governance to complement the work of the Office of the Pacific Ocean Commissioner, and support development of blue economy opportunities, including action to&#xA0;combat marine pollution.</narrative>
  </description>
